=== a11y ===
  The diagram is one image element (accessibilityElement(children:.ignore) + .isImage) with a localized
  label (default "Flow diagram", overridable) + a per-node value summary (label + formattedValue, falling
  back to the one-decimal magnitude) — VoiceOver speaks the whole graph. Decorative symbols/labels are
  accessibilityHidden. Retry/Refresh carry explicit accessibilityLabels. Dynamic Type via system fonts;
  Reduce Motion honored on the dash animation and the value roll.

=== telemetry (P1/S11) ===
  WidgetFlowDiagram emits a `view.opened` (screen_view) event once on first appear via the injectable
  WidgetFlowDiagramTelemetry seam (OSLog default), surface slug "WidgetFlowDiagram". The emission is
  funnelled through WidgetFlowDiagramDiagnostics.recordOpen so the contract is unit-tested deterministically.

